        if (room == 12 && station == 1) return "Search enemy moves from the beginning for Shield. If Shield is found, set that entry to Wait and save the list. Finding gives the entry's position; it does not remove anything. Replacing it keeps every other move in place. Powers and targets stay still. A runs your current altar code; this is the job to write."
